OL,3,GNEWSAHow much art does your council own
OL,4,Aand is it locked away or on display?
OL,5,
OL,6,FYet many face a strain on storage space
OL,7,Fand resources, with a real-term fall in
OL,8,Fspending for museums leading to
OL,9,Fchallenges in displaying council-owned
OL,10,Fart.
